Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.03,0:00:14.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好啊 迪恩 我是莉莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi,dean. it's me, Lilith.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.10,0:00:15.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是真的莉莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not real!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.13,0:00:16.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么了 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter,dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.40,0:00:18.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道你忘了在这里的欢乐时光吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you remember all the fun you had down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.63,0:00:20.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救命啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.93,0:00:22.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又见到你了 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello again,dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.20,0:00:25.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不记得我了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you recognize me? ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.26,0:00:27.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在地狱里可走的挺近的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we were so close... in hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.36,0:00:28.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿拉斯泰尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alastair.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.83,0:00:31.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们用各种方式将我扒皮\N{\fnArial\fs30}They sliced...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.66,0:00:33.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钻心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carved...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.06,0:00:37.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拆骨直到\N{\fnArial\fs30}And tore at me in ways that you...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.03,0:00:39.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿拉斯泰尔给我开出了离开邢台的条件是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And alastair would make me an offer to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.55,0:00:42.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我去折磨那些被禁锢的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take me off the rack if I started the torturing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.83,0:00:46.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而每一天  我都告诉他我会坚持到新生\N{\fnArial\fs30}And every day,i told him to stick it where the sun shines.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.13,0:00:48.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,整整30年来  我都这样跟他说\N{\fnArial\fs30}For 30 years,I told him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.23,0:00:50.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我无法再忍受了 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I couldn't do it anymore,sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.40,0:00:52.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之后我离开了那个行刑台\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I got off that rack.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.16,0:00:55.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我则开始折磨它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I started ripping them apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.63,0:01:00.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都不记得了我折磨过多少灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost count of how many souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.53,0:01:28.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw,come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.33,0:01:31.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ohh,crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.26,0:01:39.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.80,0:02:00.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.13,0:02:03.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-it's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.43,0:02:05.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,离我远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.80,0:02:10.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,离我远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.80,0:02:20.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[邪恶力量 第4季11集]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.36,0:02:40.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.70,0:02:43.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得我是在干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's it look like I'm doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.26,0:02:45.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像是在找工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you're looking for a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.16,0:02:46.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那像是掷骰子的游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yahtzee.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.63,0:02:55.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们2个小时前刚干完活\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just finished a job like two hours ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.20,0:02:57.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肾上腺素还在分泌我猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adrenaline's still pumping,I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.06,0:02:58.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,what do you think...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.96,0:03:01.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,锡达拉皮兹 塔尔萨还是芝加哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cedar rapids,tulsa,or chi-town?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.93,0:03:04.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把所有的力气都用在这事上 我说的是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am all for working. I really am.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.50,0:03:08.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过你带着咱俩马不停蹄的猎杀快1个月了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you got us chasing cases nonstop for like a month now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.70,0:03:10.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们得睡觉 -等我们死了就可以睡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need sleep. ah,we can sleep when we're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.00,0:03:12.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你已经精疲力竭了 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're exhausted,dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.16,0:03:13.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我很好 -不 才不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm good. no,you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.60,0:03:15.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你带着怒气在猎杀 但你不能一辈子这样下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're running on fumes,and you can't run forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.90,0:03:18.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我带着什么在猎杀恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what am I running from?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.53,0:03:22.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带着你告诉我的那些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}From what you told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.03,0:03:26.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是我们在假装那些事从没发生过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or are we pretending that never happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.36,0:03:32.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,内布拉斯加州 斯坦顿 一个农场小镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stratton,nebraska -- farm town.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.20,0:03:35.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一男子被砍死在一个大门和房间都上锁的屋子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man gets hacked to death in a locked room inside a locked house.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.00,0:03:37.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有侵入的迹象\N{\fnArial\fs30}No signs of forced entry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.83,0:03:39.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听起来想鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.00,0:03:41.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes,it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.50,0:05:11.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,3个卧室 2个浴室外加1个杀人犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy,three bedrooms,two baths,and one homicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.26,0:05:13.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这地方和蛋糕一样受欢迎\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place is gonna sell like hotcakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.60,0:05:35.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来看看这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey,check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.43,0:05:41.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能是小型升降机\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's probably a dumbwaiter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.83,0:05:44.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大多数老房子都有这玩意儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}All these old houses had them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.36,0:05:45.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是无所不知啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Know-it-all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.50,0:05:47.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.50,0:05:48.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.53,0:05:49.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说..\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.96,0:05:51.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.10,0:05:52.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.60,0:06:02.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有血迹,刚上的墙面漆 挺不错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,no bloodstains,fresh coat of paint,this is a bunch of bubkes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.70,0:06:05.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这插满了针\N{\fnArial\fs30}Needle's all over the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.56,0:06:07.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是电线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah -- power lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.16,0:06:08.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.90,0:06:10.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么...\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.13,0:06:19.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是最烦人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,that's super-disturbing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.40,0:06:21.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难不成在这地方弄完之后留下的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think it got left behind?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.40,0:06:22.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁会这么干\N{\fnArial\fs30}By who?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.66,0:06:25.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除非比尔 吉布森喜欢玩娃娃头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless bill gibson likes to play with doll heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.86,0:06:34.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想你说过这地方还在出售中\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you said this place was still for sale.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.73,0:06:36.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,显然不是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently,it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.73,0:06:46.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来啊 巴斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on,buster!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.96,0:06:53.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,觉得怎么样 很漂亮不是么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think? it's nice,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.26,0:06:57.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁在我们来之前会无聊的来这里看房\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did anyone bother to check if we get a signal out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.76,0:06:59.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我 凯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually,i did,kate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.76,0:07:03.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之我们决定搬家的时候就已经毁了你的一生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we decided to move anyway,just to ruin your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.66,0:07:04.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.66,0:07:06.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把行李卸下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's unpack.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.33,0:07:08.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,泰德叔叔 把我的放这里就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uncle ted,please back me up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.73,0:07:10.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子是对的 布莱恩 你毁了她的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kid's right,bri. you're ruining her life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.10,0:07:11.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}See?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.10,0:07:12.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多谢 泰德叔叔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for the help,une ted.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.90,0:07:14.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是说了大实话 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}I call it like I see it,buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.76,0:07:16.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.76,0:07:17.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.76,0:07:18.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我当然棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.20,0:07:22.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,觉得怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.86,0:07:24.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干的还不错吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.36,0:07:26.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.06,0:07:37.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.73,0:07:41.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能帮上什么忙么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.93,0:07:43.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是新的房主\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. are you the new owner?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.63,0:07:45.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 你们是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. you guys are...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.90,0:07:48.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这位是斯坦威先生 我是巴巴尔先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is mr. stanwyk. I'm mr. babar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.76,0:07:51.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,城镇执行处的\N{\fnArial\fs30}County code enforcement.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.10,0:07:54.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这房子我们已经检查过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had the building inspected last week.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.66,0:07:55.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.83,0:08:00.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,的确有点小问题 我们在墙壁内侧发现了石棉会导致漏气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Asbestos in the walls,a gas leak -- yeah,i'd say we got a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.10,0:08:02.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,石棉 什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Asbestos? meaning what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.20,0:08:04.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到我们确定没有问题 否则这里不能住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meaning until this house is up to code,it's uninhabitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.16,0:08:07.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在说我们不能住这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're saying we can't stay here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.00,0:08:09.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会有健康危害 我想你不会希望看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a health hazard. you don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.66,0:08:13.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等 我们刚开了400英里的车来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold up. we just drove 400 miles.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.43,0:08:15.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这条路往下开就是汽车旅馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a motel just down the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.36,0:08:18.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挺干净的 我建议住那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Till this gets cleaned up,I suggest you stay there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.13,0:08:19.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 如果不同意呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right,and what if we don't?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.00,0:08:22.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会吃到罚单并坐牢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,you get a fine,you go to jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.13,0:08:23.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后果自负\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pick your poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.10,0:08:33.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就一晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}One night.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.46,0:08:37.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就一晚 我会尽快解决这一切 我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}One night,and I'll take care of everything,a.s.a.p. -- I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.36,0:08:38.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做的好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,you do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.96,0:08:41.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又是汽车旅馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another motel?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.13,0:08:42.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是好极了  老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome,dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.50,0:08:44.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我希望这家也会有妓女清单  就像昨晚那家一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope this one has hooker sheets,like the last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.96,0:08:46.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.60,0:08:50.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上车了  丹尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on,danny!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.16,0:08:53.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当你发现时房子里的情况是什么样  凯瑞太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did the room look like when you found it,mrs. curry?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.60,0:08:56.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经和当地的警察说过了  那儿有血\N{\fnArial\fs30}I already told the local boys -- there was blood...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.56,0:08:57.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到处都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.56,0:09:00.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那吉布森先生  他的尸体在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}And mr. gibson -- where was he?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.20,0:09:01.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到处都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.33,0:09:05.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你花了多少时间才将吉布森先生的屋子打扫干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long have you been cleaning mr. gibson's house?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.66,0:09:07.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概五年左右\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm. about five years.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.66,0:09:08.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说你应该非常了解他\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you knew him pretty well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.80,0:09:11.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能算非常  他完全过着与世隔绝的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,not really well. he was real private.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.20,0:09:12.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但生活却一点都不简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not the easiest man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.56,0:09:13.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是在责备他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not that I blame him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.00,0:09:15.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的意思是\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.96,0:09:17.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他妻子在分娩时过世了\N{\fnArial\fs30}His wife dies in childbirth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.66,0:09:19.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,20年后  女儿又在阁楼上上吊自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daughter hangs herself in the attic 20 years later.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.30,0:09:21.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都觉得难以接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd be bitter,too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.53,0:09:23.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想我留了些照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I got some pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.86,0:09:32.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.23,0:09:34.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.20,0:09:37.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以给我们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we keep these?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.50,0:09:38.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suit yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.63,0:09:41.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个女儿为什么要自杀呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now,why'd the daughter kill herself?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.33,0:09:43.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不清楚  那是在我来之前的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. that was before my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.16,0:09:45.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在打扫时有没有发现什么奇怪的东西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you ever notice anything odd in the house when you were cleaning it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.56,0:09:46.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比如说呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.73,0:09:49.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比如  像灯会忽闪忽闪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like,you know,like lights going on and off,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.45,0:09:51.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,东西会移位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things not being where you left them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.96,0:09:52.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.50,0:09:56.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过  到是有一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,maybe there was one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.06,0:09:57.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.36,0:10:00.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有时候  我觉得我听到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,sometimes,I thought I heard like a...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.63,0:10:02.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,墙里面的沙沙声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rustling in the walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.30,0:10:04.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-像有只老鼠  -是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Like a rat? - yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.43,0:10:07.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说不定是某些小王八羔子在外面恶作剧呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must have been some big sons of guns out there,huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.30,0:10:09.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道  一个人影都没见到过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't know. never saw any.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.86,0:10:11.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you happen to know
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.60,0:10:13.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吉布森太太和她女儿被埋葬在哪里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}where mrs. gibson and her daughter were buried?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.80,0:10:16.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们都是火葬的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah,they were both cremated.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.43,0:10:17.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.53,0:10:20.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来这不可能和妈妈或是女儿有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it probably wasn't the mom or the daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.76,0:10:22.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个鬼究竟是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whose ghost was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.26,0:10:23.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.50,0:10:27.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过我知道我们需要回到那儿进行一次彻底的调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I say we give that place a real once-over and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.13,0:10:35.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,强制规定  一派胡言  根本就没有石棉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Code enforcement,my ass. there's no asbestos.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.76,0:10:36.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你确定  -是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You sure? - hell yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.74,0:10:39.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我修过那么多房子绝对可以肯定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've built enough homes to know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.16,0:10:40.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根本就没有煤气泄漏\N{\fnArial\fs30}No gas leak,either.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.33,0:10:41.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那那两个家伙是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who were those guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.63,0:10:44.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝不是乡下的人  这是我唯一可以肯定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not from the county -- I can tell you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.26,0:10:59.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.53,0:11:03.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然  当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.63,0:11:06.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是觉得我刚才看到了什么  就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just thought I saw something,that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.06,0:11:12.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在  在这儿一切都会好起来的  凯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}It -- it's gonna be great here,kate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.43,0:11:13.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.03,0:11:16.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然  妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.13,0:11:18.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.83,0:11:21.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有都会变的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything's gonna change.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.93,0:11:31.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丹尼  你在收拾你的东西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny! are you unpacking?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.50,0:11:34.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 我就快收拾好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh,yeah. I'm almost finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.63,0:12:05.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.86,0:12:10.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没关系的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.16,0:12:18.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是丹尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm danny.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.13,0:12:35.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,南瓜很易种植  但种植甜菜就需要酸度较大的土壤\N{\fnArial\fs30}"zucchini will grow,but the soil is too acidic for beets."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.93,0:12:37.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你懂这些吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand any of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.83,0:12:39.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有闻到那味道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you smell that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.40,0:12:43.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那味道\N{\fnArial\fs30}That.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.73,0:12:46.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闻起来就像是有一只浣熊或是什么东西死在那里面一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It smells like a raccoon died up there or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.36,0:12:47.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那很幽默  谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's pleasant. thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.80,0:12:50.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以继续我刚才的自言自语吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I continue having a conversation with myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.83,0:12:52.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  我在听呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,i'm listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.13,0:12:54.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个...蔬菜园\N{\fnArial\fs30}A...vegetable garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.56,0:13:02.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们这是在干嘛 布莱恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we doing,bri?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.86,0:13:04.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.46,0:13:07.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们  在一个农场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Us...on a farm...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.56,0:13:10.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,讨论南瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talking about zucchini.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.96,0:13:15.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里将来一定会不一样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna be different.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.93,0:13:18.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我向你保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.90,0:13:22.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们一定会很幸福的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.46,0:13:25.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是如果没有呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if we're not?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.26,0:13:26.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定会\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.80,0:13:28.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,必须幸福\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.13,0:13:32.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能让孩子们再重蹈去年的覆辙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't put the kids through another year like the last.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.96,0:13:42.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真胡来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.86,0:13:45.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在该做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.46,0:13:47.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以直接告诉他们事实的真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could tell them the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.60,0:13:48.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.60,0:13:50.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.20,0:14:01.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  你们俩  过来看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey,guys! you're gonna want to come see this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.60,0:14:08.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.86,0:14:15.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蜡笔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crayon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.36,0:14:18.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丹尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.50,0:14:20.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我乖乖下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your butt down here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.53,0:14:23.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-告诉你  如果是我的孩子这么做  -他不是你的孩子  泰德  \N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tell you what,if my kid did this. - he's not your kid,ted.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.34,0:14:25.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别管这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just butt out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.83,0:14:29.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  别太严厉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. go easy on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.90,0:14:31.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他老师说过他也许只是在发泄\N{\fnArial\fs30}The teacher said he might act out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.06,0:14:35.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  小家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey,buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.70,0:14:39.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是不是有事该向我和你妈妈坦白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something you want to tell me and your mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.30,0:14:41.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是我干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.13,0:14:44.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.63,0:14:48.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  你只要说实话  然后把它清理干净就行了  明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look,just tell me the truth,and all you got to do is clean it up,okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.70,0:14:49.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会处罚你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No punishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.70,0:14:51.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但不是我干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.03,0:14:52.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是墙里的那个女孩子干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The girl in the walls did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.00,0:14:54.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,墙里的女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}The girl in the walls?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.76,0:14:56.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她希望你们离开这儿而让我留下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wants you to go and me to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.43,0:14:59.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行了  最后一次  实话  小家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right,one last time -- the truth,buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.86,0:15:01.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.26,0:15:04.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以留下来  但是她讨厌大人  如果你们不离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can stay,but she hates grown-ups,and if you don't leave,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.06,0:15:05.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她真的真的会发狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's gonna get really,really mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.76,0:15:07.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  回房间去\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right,go to your room.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.23,0:15:08.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.33,0:15:16.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果安迪在这儿  他一定信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}If andy were here,he'd believe me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.10,0:15:17.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上楼去  马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Upstairs -- now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.76,0:15:35.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事的  巴斯特  没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay,buster. it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.06,0:15:37.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不喜欢这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate it here,too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.76,0:15:43.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巴斯特  恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ew,buster! gross!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.16,0:15:45.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.10,0:15:56.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.43,0:15:57.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,god.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.26,0:16:07.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-额哦   -没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ew! ew! - it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.83,0:16:10.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡蒂  宝贝  宝贝  冷静下来告诉我们怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katie,baby,baby. calm down and tell us what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.63,0:16:12.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我刚刚被令人毛骨悚然的类似鬼马精灵的鬼骚扰\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just got molested by casper the pervy ghost!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.80,0:16:14.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-这就是经过  -鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's what happened! - ghost?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.20,0:16:15.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  爸爸  一只鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes,dad -- a ghost!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.30,0:16:16.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是墙里的女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the girl in the walls!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.63,0:16:18.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.43,0:16:20.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个都给我住嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both of you,knock it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.10,0:16:25.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们听见尖叫声  出什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We heard screams. what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.36,0:16:27.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个碰过我女儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,you two! did you touch my daughter?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.96,0:16:29.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么  没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? no.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.56,0:16:30.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们俩是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.93,0:16:31.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放轻松点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax,please.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.93,0:16:33.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们遇见鬼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.96,0:16:34.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}A ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.96,0:16:36.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉过你  是个女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you! it's the girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.76,0:16:38.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们俩都放轻松点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both of you,relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.70,0:16:40.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们演的是哪出戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you guys playing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.23,0:16:42.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们一家都有危险  需要马上离开这房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your family's in danger. you need to get out of the house now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.13,0:16:46.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,究竟怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.13,0:16:47.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有人都别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody move!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.06,0:16:52.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巴斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buster!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.33,0:16:56.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巴斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buster!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.63,0:17:00.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巴斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buster?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.33,0:17:07.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巴斯特  巴斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buster! buster!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.33,0:17:09.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么鬼东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.50,0:17:25.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巴斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buster!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.50,0:17:27.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回屋内去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go back inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.80,0:17:28.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.30,0:17:33.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不是坏人  但你们有危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are not the bad guys,but you're in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.10,0:17:34.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当务之急\N{\fnArial\fs30}First thing's first.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.60,0:17:36.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你带家人离开这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to get your family out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.50,0:17:42.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去我曾说过的汽车旅馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Head to the motel I was talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.63,0:17:43.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在那儿你们会比较安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be safe there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.80,0:17:45.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们俩要做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you two gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.40,0:17:47.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,噢不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.06,0:17:49.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,噢  见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.63,0:17:56.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,噢  去死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.23,0:18:03.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计  枪都不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude,the guns are gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.50,0:18:06.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其他的也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So is the...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.50,0:18:08.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,基本上  什么都没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Basically,everything is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.83,0:18:10.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡车也坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Truck's no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.50,0:18:12.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四轮胎都被砍破了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both tires slashed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.63,0:18:15.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么样的鬼会搞轮胎啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of ghost messes with a man's wheels?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.23,0:18:17.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了  出什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on? what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.90,0:18:21.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她在那儿  在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's there! she's there!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.06,0:18:22.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.53,0:18:24.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就那儿  灌木丛中\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was right there in the woods!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.66,0:18:27.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鬼会在外面干吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's a ghost doing outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.66,0:18:29.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想留下来查个究竟吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to stay and find out?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.70,0:18:31.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有人都进屋去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.03,0:18:33.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你疯了吗  我们该离开这个鬼地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you crazy? we need to get the hell out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.40,0:18:35.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去哪里  这鬼正在追杀我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}In what?! this ghost is hunting us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.83,0:18:39.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有人马上进屋  快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody back inside now! move!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.53,0:18:44.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无论外面的是什么东西  都跨不进这个圈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever's outside,it can't get in this circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.66,0:18:48.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要盐圈不坏  这里就是最安全的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as the salt line is unbroken,this is the safest place to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.73,0:18:50.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,免于恶鬼的追杀吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Safe from ghosts?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.10,0:18:52.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  事实就是如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes,as a matter of fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.43,0:18:55.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的  我不会再听这鬼话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. I'm not listening to this anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.16,0:18:56.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.36,0:18:58.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要带我家人离开这里  我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to get my family out of here. let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.16,0:19:00.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除非我们杀了这鬼东西不然没人能离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody's going anywhere until we kill this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.13,0:19:02.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先生别这样  我们就是干这行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir,please. this is what we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.80,0:19:04.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请相信我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just...trust us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.40,0:19:06.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们猎杀鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hunt ghosts?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.43,0:19:07.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.76,0:19:09.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像史酷比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like scooby-doo?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.66,0:19:12.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更厉害点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.20,0:19:16.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在外面见过她是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw her outside,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.03,0:19:18.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的  是这俩女孩中一个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. does she look like either one of these girls?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.86,0:19:23.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.23,0:19:26.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她更苍白脏点  但确实是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was paler and a lot dirtier,but that was her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.40,0:19:28.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是墙里的女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the girl in the walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.40,0:19:30.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以是女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it's the daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.30,0:19:34.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,照片里的女孩  死了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That girl in the picture -- she-she's dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.90,0:19:38.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她在这屋里自杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She killed herself inside this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.46,0:19:46.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么女佣要歪曲她的故事呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,what -- the maid got her story wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.06,0:19:47.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丽贝卡没有被火化吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rebecca wasn't cremated?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.56,0:19:49.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除非她的思想同屋内的某种东西相联结\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless her spirit's just attached to something inside the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.96,0:19:51.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她在顶楼上吊自杀的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}She hung herself in the attic,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.56,0:19:54.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想照看他们吗  我去一探究竟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to babysit? I'll check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.20,0:19:56.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我不管谁在哪里上吊自杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look -- I don't care who hung themselves where.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.16,0:19:59.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-也许正发生着什么  但  -是思想  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe something is going on here,but -- it's a spirit,man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.46,0:20:01.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是  只是一些边远地区的乡下贱妇\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,it's just some backwoods hillbilly bitch,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.10,0:20:02.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才不会因此\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm not about to sit around here
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.50,0:20:04.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而坐等她来拯救我的危机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Waiting for her to go all "deliverance" on my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.53,0:20:07.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-没人可以离开这房子  -阻止我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well,nobody's leaving the house. - stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.46,0:20:13.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  伙计  我有枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen,man. I've got a gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.13,0:20:15.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不回到圈内\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't get your ass back in that circle,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.24,0:20:17.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就让你身上穿洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna have yourself a third hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.26,0:20:27.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计  你没枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude,you don't have a gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.80,0:20:29.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那又怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.13,0:20:32.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今晚我不会让那杂种的或其他人死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not letting that bastard or anyone else die tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.96,0:20:35.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冷静了没\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.63,0:20:37.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.36,0:20:46.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  酷男\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. fonzie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.36,0:20:49.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问你个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Question for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.03,0:20:51.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个用盐围成的不可破坏的力量区域\N{\fnArial\fs30}This indestructible force field made out of salt...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.73,0:20:54.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,必须是洁净或什么吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have to be kosher stuff,or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.63,0:20:55.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别说了  特德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knock it off,ted.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.63,0:21:03.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.20,0:21:25.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.93,0:21:30.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  所有人保持镇定\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right,everybody stay calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.93,0:21:33.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是只鬼  进不到圈子里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a ghost. she can't come in the circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.76,0:21:53.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是说鬼魂不能跨过这个圈吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you said ghosts couldn't cross the circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.53,0:21:55.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是不能  所以她不是鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can't. she's not a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.26,0:21:56.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开枪射她  射她  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot her! shoot her!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.18,0:21:57.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这恐怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}yeah,about that...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.13,0:21:59.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快跑  快  快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go,go,go! move!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.80,0:22:27.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.30,0:22:28.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-其他人在哪  -藏起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is everybody? - hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.50,0:22:30.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  把他们找出来  快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right,go get them. go. go get them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.10,0:22:32.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不是鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,it's not a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.50,0:22:35.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-只是个女孩  -不只是个女孩  是疯子内尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So,it's just a girl? - it's not just a girl. it's psycho nell.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.16,0:22:36.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要我说  绝对是个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you,man -- humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.80,0:22:37.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那她是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,who is she,then?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.00,0:22:40.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道  也许是那个女儿  丽贝卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. maybe it's the daughter,rebecca.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.20,0:22:41.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许她没上吊自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe she didn't hang herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.43,0:22:42.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可能  否则她现在都50岁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude,no. she'd have to be like 50 years old by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.93,0:22:44.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不清楚  你在阁楼上找到什么没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,i don't know. what'd you find in the attic?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.96,0:22:47.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,基本是些破烂  我找到了丽贝卡的日记\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some old junk. I found rebecca's diary. that's about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.76,0:22:49.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还指望你找个榴弹炮来呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish you'd found a howitzer.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.13,0:22:51.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我们必须保证这家人的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen,we got to get this family safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.43,0:22:53.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那只是个人  这样他们可以逃走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean,it's just a human,so they can make a run for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.70,0:22:54.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们只要拖住她\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just got to hold her off.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.80,0:22:55.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.80,0:22:57.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丹尼  泰德  我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny! ted! we got to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.43,0:22:58.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm good!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.76,0:23:00.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丹尼  快出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny! come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.33,0:23:01.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丹尼  伙计  我们要走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny,buddy,we got to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.83,0:23:02.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉过你们那是个疯婆娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Told you it was some crazy bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.98,0:23:04.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是  你说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}yes,you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.16,0:23:06.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到镇上去  我们随后就到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey,uh,head to town. we'll take it from here,okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.40,0:23:08.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丹尼  宝贝  我们要出发了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny,come on,baby! we're leaving!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.60,0:23:11.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丹尼  要走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny,we got to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.83,0:23:19.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,布莱恩  他  他在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brian,where -- where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.03,0:23:23.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丹尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.26,0:23:29.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丹尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.60,0:23:30.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,苏萨  苏萨  苏萨  苏萨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suse,suse,suse,suse.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.63,0:23:32.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会找到他的  我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will find danny. I promise you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.76,0:23:33.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.80,0:23:35.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带上凯特  立刻就走\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,take kate and go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.10,0:23:36.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上  趁还有机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now! while you still have a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.66,0:23:37.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没找到丹尼我不走  绝不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not without danny! no way!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.90,0:23:39.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不要单独跟妈妈走到外面去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not going out there with mom alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.63,0:23:40.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她说的没错  她是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's right. she's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.40,0:23:41.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我们找到你们儿子前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until we find your son
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.50,0:23:44.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,车棚是最安全的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}the safest place for you right now is in the shed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.50,0:23:46.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不去那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not going in there,either.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.23,0:23:47.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你必须去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes,you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.26,0:23:48.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那里最安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is the best defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.63,0:23:50.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,窗都封死了  而且只有一个门\N{\fnArial\fs30}The windows are boarded up. it's got one door.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.46,0:23:52.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那儿是我们目前最好的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's our best shot right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.33,0:23:54.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.33,0:23:56.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,苏萨  凯特  走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suse,kate...go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.80,0:23:58.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.00,0:23:59.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.00,0:24:01.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你跟我看着外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and me will take the outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.83,0:24:03.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们两去屋里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two take the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.23,0:24:04.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.26,0:24:16.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.13,0:24:19.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是人  肯定要有个住处\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's human. she had to come from somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.13,0:24:27.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你受得了这味儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You smell that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.06,0:24:28.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,习惯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.33,0:24:53.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.40,0:25:30.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不能下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not going down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.50,0:25:34.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,do you want to?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.30,0:25:42.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,千万别拽我的脚  千万别拽我的脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please nobody grab my leg. please nobody grab my leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.26,0:26:11.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狗  晚餐吃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dog -- it's what's for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.13,0:26:15.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丹尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.13,0:26:16.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.46,0:26:20.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到了  她的厨房\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah -- her kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.10,0:26:22.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她的什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her what?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.00,0:27:41.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们为什么要一直傻站在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look...why are we just standing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.23,0:27:43.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们进去吧  检查下房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go in. let's check the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.30,0:27:46.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须在这里等他们回来  明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to wait for those guys to get back,okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.70,0:27:48.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  是我  让我进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam,it's me. help me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.90,0:27:57.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们找到丹尼了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you get danny?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.10,0:28:02.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.27,0:28:04.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}No?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.44,0:28:06.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那泰德在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}W-well,where's ted?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.47,0:28:07.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.87,0:28:10.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么他不进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,why doesn't he come inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.60,0:28:17.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我还得把他带出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I had to carry him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.94,0:28:19.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.57,0:28:21.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是  那是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does -- what does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.80,0:28:23.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说对不起是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that mean that you're sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.74,0:28:25.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说他死了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you saying that he's dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.74,0:28:27.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  他没说他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. he's not saying that he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.97,0:28:29.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是这个意思  对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not saying that,are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.00,0:28:32.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在墙里  然后她袭击我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were in the walls,and she attacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.50,0:28:37.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没能及时救到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I couldn't get to him in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.80,0:28:40.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,泰德叔叔死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uncle ted is dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.44,0:28:46.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不该让他单独留下的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shouldn't have left him alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.64,0:28:51.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真的很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm very sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.30,0:29:06.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会找到他的  苏萨  一定会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll find him,suse. we will.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.60,0:29:08.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有哪里没查过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where else is there to look?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.77,0:29:09.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丹尼死了  对不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny's dead,isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.87,0:29:11.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不  苏萨  -为什么不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No,suse. - why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.77,0:29:13.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她杀了我弟弟  现在又杀了我儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}She killed my brother,now she killed my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.94,0:29:15.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  丹尼还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,danny is alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.57,0:29:17.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. no,he isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.04,0:29:18.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  他活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes,he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.20,0:29:20.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还记得他说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you remember what he said
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.10,0:29:22.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住在墙里的女孩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}about the girl who lived in the walls?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.04,0:29:23.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她说他可以留着\N{\fnArial\fs30}She said he could stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.84,0:29:25.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.17,0:29:26.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.34,0:29:29.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是不懂为什么我们要受这种罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just don't understand why this happens to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.94,0:29:33.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是好人  是很好的一家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean,we're good people. we're a good family.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.57,0:29:36.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安迪的事已经发生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to andy happened,okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.04,0:29:37.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我对它无能为力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot change that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.84,0:29:40.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我会找到丹尼的  我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I will find danny. I promise you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.00,0:29:43.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我找到他之后  一切就都会好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when I do,we are gonna be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.94,0:29:48.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和我  还有孩子们  我们都会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and me,the kids -- we're gonna be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.04,0:30:08.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安迪是你儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy your son?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.74,0:30:14.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,长子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oldest.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.80,0:30:20.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他去年出车祸死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He got himself killed in a car accident last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.94,0:30:25.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.67,0:30:28.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和苏萨差点为此崩溃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nearly tore suse and I apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.87,0:30:32.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且恐怕现在还没缓过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still could,i imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.56,0:30:40.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,新的环境  新的开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fresh air,fresh start.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.76,0:30:42.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,甚至不是我说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not even my line.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.13,0:30:44.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,婚姻顾问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marriage counselor.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.26,0:30:47.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许她说的对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or she might be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.76,0:30:53.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毕竟  在乡下  没什么是过不去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}After all,what could possibly go wrong in the country?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.33,0:30:58.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会把你的儿子找回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting your son back.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.43,0:31:03.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果这是我能做的最后一件善事\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's the last godforsaken thing I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.86,0:31:08.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么这么在意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you care so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.30,0:31:12.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.23,0:31:17.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有事要跟你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.13,0:31:18.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.83,0:31:21.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丽贝卡的日记  我刚读完它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rebecca's diary. I just finished reading it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.90,0:31:22.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.93,0:31:24.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在那后面的女孩   \N{\fnArial\fs30}That girl back there --
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.94,0:31:26.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我敢肯定她是丽贝卡的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm pretty sure she was Rebecca's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.00,0:31:28.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丽贝卡有个小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rebecca had a kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.03,0:31:30.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她说的都是这个   怀孕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all she talks about -- being pregnant,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.29,0:31:32.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因怀孕而感到羞耻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Being ashamed of being pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.16,0:31:33.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  让"朱诺"（婚神星）搞定它吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Geez. rent "Juno" get over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.83,0:31:35.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  为什么孩子出生后她还要自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait -- why kill herself after the baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.80,0:31:38.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许因为他爸爸叫她肮脏的小妓女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe because her dad called her a dirty little whore and
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.42,0:31:39.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还说他要把那小孩锁起来  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Said he was gonna lock the baby up
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.96,0:31:41.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不让任何人看见\N{\fnArial\fs30}where nobody could ever see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.53,0:31:42.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他会什么要那样说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would he say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.66,0:31:46.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那孩子也是他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.00,0:31:48.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.36,0:31:50.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也就说  爸爸是孩子的爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the daddy was the baby-daddy,too?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.36,0:31:51.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙是个混球  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude was a monster,Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.00,0:31:56.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听起来像奥地利的新闻故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}A story ripped from austrian headlines.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.70,0:31:58.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这可是人  兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Humans,man.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.46,0:32:00.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她一生都被锁在这栋房子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So she's been locked up in this house her whole life?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.66,0:32:02.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看过她的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw her eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.53,0:32:04.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她有看过光吗  不能说是人类了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has she ever seen light? she's barely human.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.43,0:32:05.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  那是什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,so,what,then?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.50,0:32:07.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她像动物一样被关了起来  \N{\fnArial\fs30}She's kept caged up like an animal,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.75,0:32:10.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后她冲了出来  杀了她爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then she busts out and ganks dear dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.01,0:32:11.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老爸  爷爷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Old dad/granddad?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.16,0:32:12.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.53,0:32:14.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能说我会怪她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,can't say I blame her.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.06,0:32:15.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我敢肯定她的生活就像地狱  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure her life was hell,Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.80,0:32:18.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那也不能说明她可以随意杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That doesn't mean she gets a free pass for a murder spree.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.03,0:32:19.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像你知道地狱是怎么样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you know what hell's like.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.86,0:32:21.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.16,0:32:22.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.80,0:32:26.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们在哪可以找到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,where do we find her?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.26,0:32:32.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子总归要吃  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kid's got to eat,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.06,0:32:33.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.56,0:32:36.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他把她藏起来  并锁了起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He kept her hidden,locked up...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.70,0:32:38.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他总要给她吃的  不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he had to feed her,didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.70,0:32:39.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.70,0:32:42.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想我知道在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I know where.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.53,0:34:03.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他本来可以把她藏在下面好几年\N{\fnArial\fs30}He could have kept her hidden down here for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.16,0:34:06.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给她吃的  没人会知道这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kept her fed. nobody would ever know.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.26,0:34:11.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丹尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.23,0:34:13.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丹尼  小心  我下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny! watch out. I'm going down.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.60,0:34:15.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不  是我儿子  -我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}-No,that's my son.  -I know it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.10,0:34:17.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我说过我会找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I said that I would get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.06,0:34:18.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说到做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will. let me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.03,0:34:45.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有窗帘布吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got curtains?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.03,0:34:46.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要绳子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need rope.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.26,0:35:09.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事的 \N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.43,0:35:11.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子  没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay,baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.33,0:35:25.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这婊子简直有鹰爪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bitch is a klepto.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.86,0:35:45.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丹尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.03,0:35:51.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丹尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.60,0:35:57.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丹尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.33,0:36:08.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的爸爸就在上面  过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your dad's upstairs. come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.53,0:36:09.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.66,0:36:13.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小心头  小心你的头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch your head. watch your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.30,0:36:14.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点  他快回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry! he's coming back!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.83,0:36:16.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"他"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"He"?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.73,0:36:17.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.03,0:36:41.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丹尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.70,0:36:52.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.03,0:36:55.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点  兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on,buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.70,0:36:56.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点啊 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on,buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.93,0:36:59.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丹尼  别回头看  也别往下看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't look back,danny. just don't look down.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.10,0:37:07.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.30,0:37:12.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah! mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.40,0:37:15.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快  我抓住你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.66,0:37:17.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.20,0:37:19.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.43,0:37:22.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带他离开这里  你们赶紧走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him out of here. you got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.90,0:37:25.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.26,0:38:03.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.56,0:38:04.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah! no!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.33,0:38:09.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.43,0:38:23.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,苏丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suse!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.30,0:39:26.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你们的配合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for the head start.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.83,0:39:29.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我奇怪的是  你们俩竟然不是警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why doesn't it surprise me，you guys don't like the police?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.80,0:39:33.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,类似于...  相互欣赏之类的吧  真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sort of a,uh... mutual-appreciation thing,really.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.60,0:39:36.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.50,0:39:37.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.50,0:39:39.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.33,0:39:45.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  正好相反\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. we're the opposite of okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.06,0:39:46.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但...\N{\fnArial\fs30}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.93,0:39:49.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少我们在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're together.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.83,0:40:19.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.36,0:40:23.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗  我觉得这些狗娘养的全都要下地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know,I felt for those sons of bitches back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.50,0:40:27.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,终生的折磨会让你变成像那样的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lifelong torture turns you into something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.50,0:40:29.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你进过地狱的  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were in hell,dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.50,0:40:35.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  或许你在下面做了不该做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look,maybe you did what you did there...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.76,0:40:37.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你不像他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're not them.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.46,0:40:39.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们不能算是人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were barely human.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.90,0:40:42.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.03,0:40:44.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不像他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't like them.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.13,0:40:45.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我比他们更坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.50,0:40:48.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们只是动物  山姆  只想捍卫自己的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were animals,Sam,defending territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.50,0:40:50.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.76,0:40:52.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我却是在享受\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did it for the sheer pleasure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.50,0:40:55.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.50,0:40:58.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,山姆 我喜欢那样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I enjoyed it,sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.83,0:41:02.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们把我从架子放下来  然后我折磨那些灵魂  \N{\fnArial\fs30}They took me off the rack,and I tortured souls,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.91,0:41:05.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并且还很享受\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I liked it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.43,0:41:09.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么多年来...\N{\fnArial\fs30}All those years...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.76,0:41:11.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有的痛苦...\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that pain...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.90,0:41:15.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,终于让你自己也尝到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finally getting to deal some out yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.73,0:41:22.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我甚至不关心他们把谁放在我的面前\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't care who they put in front of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.83,0:41:22.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我感受到的痛苦..\N{\fnArial\fs30}That pain I felt...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.86,0:41:25.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,慢慢地消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It just slipped away.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.50,0:41:31.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管我救了多少人...\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter how many people I save...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.26,0:41:33.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也改变不了那样的事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't change that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.03,0:41:38.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根本不能弥补\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't fill this hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.53,0:41:43.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永远不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.44,0:30:38.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们搬到这里来\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why we moved here.
